Let $\Psi^{ij}=-\Psi^{ji},
\qquad
i,j=1,\ldots,5.$ All diagonal entries vanish, and the lower triangle is fixed by the upper triangle. Hence $\dim\mathbf{10}
=\binom52
=\frac{5\cdot4}{2}
=10.$

